Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you guys looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a poster for that WWI movie I'm in. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我演的一战电影的海报  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow! It looks really violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来很暴力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I'm coming soon to a theater near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  我即将在各大戏院露面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm in THX. I'm unsuitable for children!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我经过THX认证  我不适宜儿童观看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot wait to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我等不及要看这部电影了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah. It's generating Oscar buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经有传闻说它能拿奥斯卡了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I started that!  I thought I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我先说的  我还以为是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guess what? I just talked to my agent...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚跟经纪人谈过...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:34.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the premiere is next week and you're all invited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:34.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下星期有首映会  你们通通被邀请了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Will we take a limo?  Sure! Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要坐加长豪华轿车吗  当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love taking limos when nobody died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不去参加葬礼还能坐加长车  简直太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, obviously I won't be able to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我显然没办法去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For those who haven't checked their calendars,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些还没查过日历的人听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}today's my due date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天是我的预产期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want take a moment and thank you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想借这个机会谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}for how great you've been during this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我怀孕期间一直这么照顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有你们我绝对办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I loved these last 9 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过去的九个月我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:01.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even though I'm looking forward to the next part...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:01.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽说我很期待进入下一阶段...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I am really gonna miss being pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会很怀念怀孕的这段时光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. Still no baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  我还是没生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, people, make some room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  给我腾点地方坐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:18.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, maybe you'd be more comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:18.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  或许你坐在这里会比较舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like you haven't done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对我做的孽还不够多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know how miserable you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你现在很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish there was something I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的希望能帮上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish I were a sea horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望自己是海马
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:43.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because with sea horses, it's the male. They carry the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:43.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为是公海马负责孵育小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then also, I'd be far away in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我还会生活在海里  离你远远的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have never been so uncomfortable in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这辈子从来没有这么难受过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I've been there. I remember toward the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:12.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解  我也有过这种经历  我记得最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, that's a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你的故事很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell it to me when you're getting me some iced tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能不能帮我拿杯冰茶来再说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:24.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, get out! Get out, get out, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:24.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  滚出来  滚出来  滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咱们滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第22集  瑞秋迟迟生不出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, did you have the baby yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你生完宝宝了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want me to come over there and sit on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想让我过去坐在你身上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真做得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么这么早就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They sent me home from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}公司要我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said, "Start your maternity leave now. Just rest."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们让我从现在就开始休产假  回家休息
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get ready for the baby. You know what? Screw them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为宝宝出生做好准备  去他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:30.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If they don't want me there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:30.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他们不要我待在公司
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll hang out with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就跟你们待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or you could do volunteer work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你可以去做义工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:42.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hello?  Joey, it's Estelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:42.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂  乔伊  我是艾丝特尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great news. I was able to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好消息  我帮搞你到了首映会的门票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and one guest tickets to your premiere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以带一位朋友出席
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One guess? You told me I could have six tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一位朋友  你之前说我可以拿到六张票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I sold four of them on eBay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把其中四张拿去易趣网拍卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be sitting next to HotGuy372.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会坐在"帅哥372"旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my god. So that's it? I only get to bring one guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  难道我就只能带一个朋友去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. What time you wanna pick me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  你什么时候来接我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I only get one extra ticket to my premiere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只能带一个朋友参加首映会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.45,0:04:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So somehow I have to pick between you three and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.45,0:04:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我得在你们三个跟罗斯之间做选择
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What about me?  You said you didn't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我呢  你说过你不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:26.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't. But I would still like to be acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:26.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  但我还是希望有被重视的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I'm pregnant, I'm invisible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我怀孕了就变成隐形人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Definitely not invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你绝不是隐形人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross didn't care enough to be here, so I think he's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯根本不在这里  所以他出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You snooze, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打磕睡  你就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:41.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not snoozing. He's teaching a class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:41.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有打磕睡  他在教书
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then somebody's snoozing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么一定有人在打磕睡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, Joey, not that this should affect you at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  不要因为我的话影响你的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but if you pick me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果你选了我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:53.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was planning on wearing a sequin dress cut down to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:53.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打算穿露到这里的紧身连衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't seen this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没有看过这套连衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Star in a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穿上绝对有影星风范
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, you pick whoever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你想挑谁都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen to your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听从你内心的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:05.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does it tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:05.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它跟你说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:08.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe. Phoebe. Phoebe.
